('127.113.d.1.G',3,'Trenches over 5 feet deep generally require:','["A rope", "Nothing", "Shoring or sloping", "A sign only"]'::jsonb,2,'Cave-in protection.','original'),
('127.113.d.1.G',4,'Spoil piles from a trench should be kept:','["Beneath equipment", "In the trench", "At the edge", "At least 2 feet from the edge"]'::jsonb,3,'Prevent cave-ins.','original'),
('127.113.d.1.H',3,'Lockout/tagout ensures that equipment is:','["De-energized during repair", "Hot", "Ignored", "Running"]'::jsonb,0,'Energy control.','original'),
('127.113.d.1.H',4,'Only the person who put on a lock should:','["Paint it", "Remove it", "Cut it", "Ignore it"]'::jsonb,1,'Personal lock.','original'),
('127.113.d.1.I',3,'An MSDS, now called an SDS, lists information about:','["Wages", "Tool prices", "A chemical''s hazards and handling", "Weather"]'::jsonb,2,'Safety data.','original'),
('127.113.d.1.I',4,'Before using a product like PVC cement, a worker should read its:','["Warranty", "Catalog", "Receipt", "Safety data sheet"]'::jsonb,3,'Know hazards.','original'),
