('127.113.d.4.C',3,'Selecting the right tool for the job helps prevent:','["Quality", "Damage and injury", "Success", "Accuracy"]'::jsonb,1,'Choose well.','original'),
('127.113.d.4.C',4,'Using a screwdriver as a chisel is an example of:','["Required practice", "Safe practice", "Misusing a tool", "Good practice"]'::jsonb,2,'Wrong tool.','original'),
('127.113.d.4.D',3,'Tools should be kept clean and:','["Rusty", "Wet", "Loose", "Sharp and in good repair"]'::jsonb,3,'Maintenance.','original'),
('127.113.d.4.D',4,'A mushroomed chisel head should be:','["Ground or replaced", "Hit harder", "Ignored", "Painted"]'::jsonb,0,'Hazard.','original'),
('127.113.d.4.E',3,'Before drilling a wall, check for hidden:','["Flowers", "Pipes and wiring", "Paint", "Color"]'::jsonb,1,'Check first.','original'),
('127.113.d.4.E',4,'Marking a drill location with a center punch keeps the bit from:','["Squeaking", "Heating", "Walking off the spot", "Shining"]'::jsonb,2,'Prepare surface.','original')
